      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [
        "primal"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The Tanglebriar regent sprays a blast of spores from their body, dealing 14d6 Poison Damage damage in a 50ft Type:cone (Basic DC 33 Fortitude Saving Throw save). They can't use spore spray again for 1d4 rounds.</p>",
